{"id": "a14ba360-7a91-42f2-820b-7a4a89588867", "slug": "orbital-access-pass", "title": "Orbital Access Pass", "description": "Orbital Access Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Orbital Access Pass\"\ndescription: \"Orbital Access Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#E6FF00\"\n  secondary: \"#0F172A\"\n  accent: \"#475569\"\n  background: \"#E6FF00\"\n  surface: \"#0F172A\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Orbital Access Pass\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Aksonvady Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 7; favorites: 3; remixes: 0.\nTags: section, css, layout, content, responsive.\n## Overview\nOrbital Access Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nSEQ // 01 88 + + Clearance Code: 88-X Sector Entry: Node Alpha-9 Zenith Quadrant Primary Viewing Deck / High G-Force Zone Event Protocol Active Vanguard-V Orbital Racing Series Sync Rate 0.891 Mission Briefing Commencin…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nFollow the rendered preview for headline scale, supporting copy, navigation density, and component placement.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #E6FF00, secondary #0F172A, accent #475569, background #E6FF00, surface #0F172A, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Orbital Access Pass</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-slate-950 text-slate-800 font-sans antialiased min-h-[120vh] selection:bg-[#e6ff00] selection:text-slate-900 flex flex-col items-center justify-start pt-12 pb-32 sm:pt-24 px-4 sm:px-8\">\n\n    <!-- Gradient Border Wrapper -->\n    <div id=\"ticket-wrapper\" class=\"w-full max-w-5xl rounded-sm w-full p-[1px] shadow-2xl shadow-[#e6ff00]/5\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(71,85,105,0.4) 0%, rgba(15,23,42,1) 40%, rgba(230,255,0,0.8) 100%);\">\n\n        <!-- Main Ticket Container -->\n        <div class=\"bg-[#eef5f8] w-full rounded-sm relative grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-0 overflow-hidden\" id=\"ticket-main\">\n\n            <!-- Technical Grid Overlay -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-[0.03] z-0\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 2px 2px, #0f172a 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 24px 24px;\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Left Column (Indicators) -->\n            <div class=\"md:col-span-1 lg:col-span-2 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-slate-300 relative flex flex-row md:flex-col justify-between p-4 sm:p-6 z-10 bg-white/30 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                <div class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-widest text-slate-500 uppercase md:-rotate-90 origin-top-left md:translate-y-[80px] absolute top-6 left-6 gs-fade\">SEQ // 01</div>\n\n                <!-- Yellow Accent Square -->\n                <div class=\"w-12 h-12 sm:w-16 sm:h-16 bg-[#e6ff00] border border-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-900 font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tight shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(15,23,42,1)] gs-scale\">\n                    88\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"mt-auto hidden md:flex flex-col items-center gap-3 w-full gs-fade\">\n                    <div class=\"w-[1px] h-12 bg-slate-300\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-slate-900 rotate-45\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-[#e6ff00] rotate-45 border border-slate-900\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Column (Data Content) -->\n            <div class=\"md:col-span-11 lg:col-span-10 flex flex-col z-10\">\n\n                <!-- Top Row -->\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 border-b border-slate-300\">\n                    <!-- Designation -->\n                    <div class=\"lg:col-span-5 p-6 sm:p-10 border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-slate-300 flex flex-col justify-center relative\">\n                        <!-- Crosshairs -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 text-slate-300 text-xs gs-fade\">+</div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 text-slate-300 text-xs gs-fade\">+</div>\n\n                        <div class=\"text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500 mb-4 gs-slide-up\">Clearance Code:</div>\n                        <div style=\"overflow: hidden;\">\n                            <div class=\"text-7xl sm:text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-medium tracking-tighter leading-none text-slate-900 gs-mask-reveal\">\n                                88-X\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Sector Info -->\n                    <div class=\"lg:col-span-7 p-6 sm:p-10 relative flex flex-col justify-center\">\n                        <div class=\"text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500 mb-4 flex justify-between w-full gs-slide-up\">\n                            <span>Sector Entry:</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-slate-900 font-semibold\">Node Alpha-9</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"overflow: hidden;\" class=\"mb-2\">\n                            <div class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-slate-900 gs-mask-reveal\">\n                                Zenith Quadrant\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"overflow: hidden;\">\n                            <div class=\"text-lg text-slate-500 tracking-tight gs-mask-reveal\">\n                                Primary Viewing Deck / High G-Force Zone\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Technical Badge -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-8 right-8 w-16 h-16 bg-slate-900 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-white rounded-full shadow-lg gs-scale\">\n                           <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:radar-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-[#e6ff00]\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Event Title Row -->\n                <div class=\"p-6 sm:p-10 border-b border-slate-300 relative bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end gap-8\">\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 gs-slide-up\">\n                                <span class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-[#e6ff00] inline-block\"></span>\n                                Event Protocol Active\n                            </div>\n                            <div style=\"overflow: hidden;\">\n                                <div class=\"text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-semibold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 gs-mask-reveal\">\n                                    Vanguard-V\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div style=\"overflow: hidden; margin-top: 4px;\">\n                                <div class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-slate-600 gs-mask-reveal\">\n                                    Orbital Racing Series\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"text-left md:text-right w-full md:w-auto\">\n                             <div class=\"text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500 mb-2 border-b border-slate-300 pb-2 md:border-none md:pb-0 gs-slide-up\">Sync Rate</div>\n                             <div style=\"overflow: hidden;\">\n                                <div class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tighter text-slate-900 gs-mask-reveal\">\n                                    0.891\n                                </div>\n                             </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Scroll Triggered Masked Reveal Section -->\n                <div class=\"p-6 sm:p-10 bg-slate-200/40 border-b border-slate-300 relative\" id=\"briefing-section\">\n                     <!-- Subtle border gradient line inside -->\n                     <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[2px]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, #e6ff00, transparent);\"></div>\n\n                     <div class=\"text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500 mb-6 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                        <span>Mission Briefing</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:sort-by-time-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                     </div>\n                     <p class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight text-slate-800 max-w-3xl\" id=\"briefing-text\">\n                        Commencing high-velocity transit. Verify harness engagement. Auxiliary thruster sync initiated. Prepare for atmospheric exit vector.\n                     </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Bottom Row: Sponsors & Barcode -->\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2\">\n\n                    <!-- Logos -->\n                    <div class=\"p-6 sm:p-10 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-slate-300 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-10 place-items-center bg-[#e4eff4]\">\n                        <div class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-slate-800 uppercase gs-logo\">Nexa</div>\n                        <div class=\"text-xl font-medium tracking-widest text-slate-600 uppercase flex items-center gap-2 gs-logo\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:planet-linear\"></iconify-icon>\n                            Aeris\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 gs-logo\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:screencast-2-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-[#e6ff00] drop-shadow-[0_0_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)]\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-800 uppercase\">Vortex</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-lg font-medium tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-500 uppercase gs-logo\">S Y N</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Barcode Zone -->\n                    <div class=\"p-6 sm:p-10 bg-[#e6ff00] flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group\">\n                        <!-- Animated scan line -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-[2px] bg-white opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 shadow-[0_0_10px_2px_rgba(255,255,255,0.8)] z-20 pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-300\" id=\"scan-line\"></div>\n\n                        <div class=\"text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-8 flex justify-between items-end gs-fade\">\n                            <span>Auth Sequence</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-right\">Scan to<br>Authenticate</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Deterministic Barcode generation -->\n                        <div class=\"flex h-20 sm:h-24 w-full items-end gap-[2px] sm:gap-[3px] gs-barcode justify-between\">\n                            <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[6px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[4px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[8px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[6px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[10px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[4px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[8px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[6px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[4px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[8px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[4px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-[6px] h-full bg-slate-950 origin-bottom\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n\n            // Utility: Split text into span-wrapped words for staggered reveal\n            function splitTextForScroll(elementId) {\n                const el = document.getElementById(elementId);\n                if (!el) return;\n                const text = el.innerText;\n                const words = text.split(' ');\n                el.innerHTML = '';\n\n                words.forEach(word => {\n                    const outerSpan = document.createElement('span');\n                    outerSpan.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    outerSpan.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                    outerSpan.style.verticalAlign = 'top';\n                    outerSpan.style.paddingRight = '0.3em'; // Space between words\n\n                    const innerSpan = document.createElement('span');\n                    innerSpan.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    innerSpan.innerText = word;\n                    innerSpan.classList.add('gs-scroll-word');\n\n                    outerSpan.appendChild(innerSpan);\n                    el.appendChild(outerSpan);\n                });\n            }\n\n            if (prefersReducedMotion) {\n                // Ensure everything is visible immediately\n                gsap.set([\"#ticket-wrapper\", \".gs-fade\", \".gs-scale\", \".gs-logo\", \".gs-barcode div\"], { opacity: 1, scale: 1, y: 0, x: 0, scaleY: 1 });\n                gsap.set(\".gs-mask-reveal\", { yPercent: 0 });\n                gsap.set(\".gs-slide-up\", { opacity: 1, y: 0 });\n            } else {\n                // Initial Setup\n                gsap.set(\"#ticket-wrapper\", { opacity: 0, y: 40, rotationX: 5, transformPerspective: 1000 });\n                gsap.set(\".gs-mask-reveal\", { yPercent: 110, skewY: 2 });\n                gsap.set(\".gs-slide-up\", { opacity: 0, y: 20 });\n                gsap.set(\".gs-fade\", { opacity: 0 });\n                gsap.set(\".gs-scale\", { opacity: 0, scale: 0.5 });\n                gsap.set(\".gs-logo\", { opacity: 0, x: -20, filter: \"blur(4px)\" });\n                gsap.set(\".gs-barcode div\", { scaleY: 0 });\n\n                // Master Intro Timeline (approx 5 seconds)\n                const masterTl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: \"power4.out\" }, delay: 0.2 });\n\n                masterTl\n                    .to(\"#ticket-wrapper\", { duration: 1.5, opacity: 1, y: 0, rotationX: 0, ease: \"expo.out\" })\n                    .to(\".gs-mask-reveal\", { duration: 1.2, yPercent: 0, skewY: 0, stagger: 0.1, ease: \"power3.out\" }, \"-=1.0\")\n                    .to(\".gs-slide-up\", { duration: 1, opacity: 1, y: 0, stagger: 0.05 }, \"-=0.8\")\n                    .to(\".gs-fade\", { duration: 1.5, opacity: 1, ease: \"none\" }, \"-=0.5\")\n                    .to(\".gs-scale\", { duration: 0.8, opacity: 1, scale: 1, ease: \"back.out(1.7)\", stagger: 0.15 }, \"-=1.2\")\n                    .to(\".gs-logo\", { duration: 0.8, opacity: 1, x: 0, filter: \"blur(0px)\", stagger: 0.1, ease: \"power2.out\" }, \"-=0.6\")\n                    .to(\".gs-barcode div\", { duration: 0.6, scaleY: 1, stagger: { amount: 0.4, from: \"random\" }, ease: \"circ.out\" }, \"-=0.4\");\n\n                // Scroll Triggered Masked Reveal Sequence\n                splitTextForScroll(\"briefing-text\");\n                gsap.set(\".gs-scroll-word\", { yPercent: 100, rotateZ: 2 });\n\n                ScrollTrigger.create({\n                    trigger: \"#briefing-section\",\n                    start: \"top 85%\", // Trigger slightly before it hits view center\n                    animation: gsap.to(\".gs-scroll-word\", {\n                        yPercent: 0,\n                        rotateZ: 0,\n                        duration: 0.8,\n                        ease: \"power3.out\",\n                        stagger: 0.03\n                    }),\n                    toggleActions: \"play reverse play reverse\"\n                });\n\n                // Infinite decorative scanline animation on the barcode area\n                gsap.to(\"#scan-line\", {\n                    y: () => document.querySelector('.gs-barcode').offsetHeight + 60,\n                    duration: 2,\n                    ease: \"linear\",\n                    repeat: -1,\n                    paused: false\n                });\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "orbital-access-pass.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/orbital-access-pass.jpg", "source_name": "orbital-access-pass-DESIGN.md", "views": 116, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T06:18:03.590748+00:00"}